#: ../../quickstart.rst:205
msgid "Error Handling"
msgstr "错误处理"

#: ../../quickstart.rst:207
msgid ""
"HX provides built-in error handling. Simply return an error from your "
"handler. Extractor failures arrive as ``*httpx.ExtractError`` and still "
"unwrap to the original error, including ``extractor.ErrEmptyValue``:"
msgstr ""
"HX 提供内置错误处理。从处理器返回错误即可。"
"提取失败会作为 ``*httpx.ExtractError`` 到达，并且仍然能 unwrap 到原始错误，"
"包括 ``extractor.ErrEmptyValue``："

#: ../../quickstart.rst:219
msgid "You can also customize error handling:"
msgstr "您也可以自定义错误处理："

